# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_1.rpy:66
translate es qst_TwoEmperors_1_f1e3c9fb:

    # "As I looked down at the faint tracks before us, I focused in hard, and as I did so, I could smell the wretched outline of their scent, guiding me forward."
    "Al mirar las débiles huellas que teníamos ante nosotros, me concentré con fuerza y, al hacerlo, pude percibir el miserable contorno de su olor, que me guiaba hacia delante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_1.rpy:67
translate es qst_TwoEmperors_1_19fe3894:

    # MC "Urghh! They reek of death!"
