    # MC "(We should avoid that thing for now... I don't think it's going to give us a second chance.)"
    MC "(Deberíamos evitar esa cosa por ahora... No creo que nos vaya a dar una segunda oportunidad)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_1.rpy:202
translate es qst_TwoEmperors_temple_clickableWater_d8fde908:

